\title{LDscnR: Chromosome-wise LD-decay estimation for population genomic data}
\description{
Linkage-disequilibrium-aware genome scans. Estimates chromosome-wise LD decay, derives a local-LD weight for every marker, and turns a per-SNP association scan into LD-supported outlier regions. Builds on the consistency C-score of Fang et al. (2021) \doi{10.1093/molbev/msab144}, integrating continuously over the LD window and stringency rather than over a menu of analyses, and keeping the score per-SNP. Markers are clustered into regions by LD and each region is tested at its own locus against surrogate scans that the user supplies, so the method is independent of the association engine and of how the null is constructed.
}
